      "source_text": "Proof of Lemma 3.4 .",
      "raw_span": null,
      "references": [
        {
          "target": "#S3.Thmtheorem4",
          "label": "3.4"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "exclusion_reason": "Structural heading; substantive content is inventoried in its named container/paragraphs/displays."
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.SS3.p2.1",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.SS3.p2.1",
      "source_text": "For $O\\in O(n)$ and $v\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n}$ , orthogonality gives $\\|Ov\\|=\\|v\\|$ . Hence, by Cauchy–Schwarz, $|\\langle v,Ov\\rangle|\\leq\\|v\\|^{2}$ . Since",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 598670,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 600489,
        "start_line": 2877,
        "end_line": 2880,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "1d62ddc94d60cfa3e8e74087354479ae1e9bc6711860886d1fc366fbdbc063e2"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "NODE"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.Ex73",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.Ex73",
      "source_text": "$v^{\\top}A_{O}v=\\frac{\\kappa+1}{2}\\|v\\|^{2}-\\frac{\\kappa-1}{2}\\langle v,Ov\\rangle,$",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 600490,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 601878,
        "start_line": 2881,
        "end_line": 2887,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "44b5ab93f2609552de8ed9c3c5b91d85ca917945a072de4996632a6bcd4cfd16"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "NODE"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.SS3.p2.2",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.SS3.p2.2",
      "source_text": "we obtain $\\|v\\|^{2}\\leq v^{\\top}A_{O}v\\leq\\kappa\\|v\\|^{2}$ . Together with $A_{O}=A_{O}^{\\top}$ , this proves",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 601879,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 603058,
        "start_line": 2888,
        "end_line": 2890,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "db848a55ac56869918287395e4be032aaf6dff02f00ba85efc469ac7a7f6335b"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "NODE"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.E26",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.E26",
      "source_text": "$I_{n}\\preceq A_{O}\\preceq\\kappa I_{n}.$ (26)",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 603059,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 603989,
        "start_line": 2891,
        "end_line": 2898,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "6c3cb18a6f49b7aa88b5f5486af29bacd3cd886ef0f226a53f00cdef0dc5092b"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "NODE"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.SS3.p3.1",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.SS3.p3.1",
      "source_text": "Now let $x=(x_{1},\\ldots,x_{k},z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}$ , where $x_{j}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n}$ and $z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d-kn}$ . Applying Eq. ( 26 ) to each block yields",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 604035,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 605610,
        "start_line": 2901,
        "end_line": 2903,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "6be8db0d496775d81706e4a3f6739ca3a056d75853e1219b6bffc89eb99941dc"
      },
      "references": [
        {
          "target": "#A2.E26",
          "label": "26"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "NODE"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.Ex74",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.Ex74",
      "source_text": "$\\displaystyle\\|x\\|^{2}$ $\\displaystyle=\\sum_{j=1}^{k}\\|x_{j}\\|^{2}+\\|z\\|^{2}$ $\\displaystyle\\leq\\sum_{j=1}^{k}x_{j}^{\\top}A_{O_{j}}x_{j}+\\|z\\|^{2}=x^{\\top}A_{\\bm{O}}x$ $\\displaystyle\\leq\\kappa\\sum_{j=1}^{k}\\|x_{j}\\|^{2}+\\|z\\|^{2}\\leq\\kappa\\|x\\|^{2}.$",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 605611,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 609780,
        "start_line": 2904,
        "end_line": 2921,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "81424a765c86d80400d96f2fd76de616d170218a0ab8436cb57d610a3656d42a"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "NODE"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.SS3.p3.2",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.SS3.p3.2",
      "source_text": "The last inequality uses $\\kappa\\geq 1$ . When $kn=d$ , the terms involving $z$ are omitted. Since $A_{\\bm{O}}$ is symmetric, these inequalities imply $I_{d}\\preceq A_{\\bm{O}}\\preceq\\kappa I_{d}$ , and therefore $A_{\\bm{O}}\\in\\mathcal{A}_{d,\\kappa}$ .",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 609781,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 611794,
        "start_line": 2922,
        "end_line": 2926,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "5aabbc8fd2d7f8705704097ad2da94a86afa7caa684c92f56b8b4e491f498bde"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "NODE"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.SS3.p4.1",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.SS3.p4.1",
      "source_text": "Finally, $f_{A_{\\bm{O}}}(0)=0$ , whereas for every $x\\neq 0$ ,",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 611840,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 612616,
        "start_line": 2929,
        "end_line": 2929,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "9fe585d2a50ec372c0c573e4444205f2bad0ee0da2aad7d0c0c947c321b00211"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "exclusion_reason": "Unique minimizer conclusion is beyond covariance/SPD admissibility; retained as explicitly excluded background."
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.Ex75",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.Ex75",
      "source_text": "$f_{A_{\\bm{O}}}(x)=\\frac{1}{2}x^{\\top}A_{\\bm{O}}x\\geq\\frac{1}{2}\\|x\\|^{2}>0.$",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 612617,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 613954,
        "start_line": 2930,
        "end_line": 2936,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "3aea34b2fc4dddaffd1edaca37d3b4794fe7675458c473f3ecf1b1fd4949101c"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "exclusion_reason": "Positive-potential/minimizer estimate is not required for the Gaussian product identity."
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "A2.SS3.p4.2",
      "section": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "raw_locator": "#A2.SS3.p4.2",
      "source_text": "Thus $0$ is the unique minimizer and the minimum value is $0$ . ∎",
      "raw_span": {
        "byte_start_inclusive": 613955,
        "byte_end_exclusive": 614468,
        "start_line": 2937,
        "end_line": 2938,
        "raw_fragment_sha256": "0dd74cb43a703dd139b789808014fd7881052940914b6b5125d5c2d78c384d38"
      },
      "references": [],
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "exclusion_reason": "Unique minimizer/minimum value conclusion is outside the law identity."
    }
  ],
